譲り合わない体温全て感じたいから
is to feel all of your unyielding body warmth.

118
00:10:18,636 --> 00:10:23,916
思うだけで不都合だらけになる心
My heart becomes full of inconveniences just by thinking.

119
00:10:24,436 --> 00:10:29,896
そんな恋人同士酷くおかしい
Such lovers are terribly strange.

120
