笑い話だね 今となれば
It's just a joke, now that we're together

232
00:18:20,023 --> 00:18:23,023
見る物全て 輝いて見えた
Everything I see shines brightly

233
00:18:23,023 --> 00:18:28,023
あの日々がキレイに 笑ってるよ
Those days are smiling beautifully

234
